  title: Acceptance
  description: "When Father took you under his wing and split us up, I spent so many
    years being \\n the second option. I was labeled as the disappointment, the failure
    of the family. \\n But that was not your fault. You were fighting to survive,
    like I was. Brother, I\u2019m sorry."
